sequenceDiagram
    participant CI
    participant Human
    participant Agent A
    participant Agent B

    Agent A->>Human: Turn complete (blocked)
    CI->>Human: Build failed
    Human->>Human: Read CI logs, copy error
    Human->>Agent A: lazy unblock "CI failed: ..."
    Agent A->>Human: Fixed, turn complete (blocked)
    Agent B->>Human: Needs upstream sync
    Human->>Human: Remember to merge parent
    Human->>Agent B: lazy unblock --sync-with-upstream
